31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. I hope you all rested well. I have spent some time reflecting on our situation, and I believe we should now begin to share our thoughts more openly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer may have some initial information. If anyone feels confident in their findings or has noticed something suspicious, now is the time to speak.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Yeah! Good morning! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? I'm ready to be a detective! Does the Seer have any secrets to tell us? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's not rush the Seer. If they have information, they'll share it when they feel it's safe. For now, let's see if anyone's behavior has changed since yesterday.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very perceptive point, Misaki. The transition from the anticipation of the first night to the reality of the first day often reveals the most. I wonder, has anyone's composure shifted in the morning light?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the patience you've all shown. While I cannot reveal everything immediately, I can say that my initial reflections have given me a sense of who we might trust. Let us continue to observe carefully.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Jonathan, your phrasing is quite ambiguous. Saying you have a ""sense of who we might trust"" without providing evidence could be a way to subtly lead the group. Are you the Seer, or just playing a role?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, Mizuki is already asking the tough questions! That's so cool! Jonathan, are you the Seer? If you are, you should tell us who the bad guy is so we can catch them right now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Mizuki is right to be cautious. Jonathan, if you are the Seer, being too vague can be dangerous. If you aren't, your words sound like you're trying to steer us. Please be more specific.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems the atmosphere has shifted from polite observation to a rather spirited interrogation. Jonathan, you've certainly piqued everyone's curiosity. I must admit, your ambiguity is almost an art form, though perhaps a risky one.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your concerns. I am indeed the Seer. I divined Benjamin last night, and he is human. I wished to be cautious, but I believe transparency is now the most peaceful path forward.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If you are the Seer, Jonathan, then Benjamin is cleared. However, we must consider if this is a genuine reveal or a strategic lie by the werewolf to gain trust. Does anyone find this timing suspicious?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Wow, Jonathan is the Seer! That's so exciting! If Benjamin is a good guy, then we only have to look at the rest of us! Does that mean the werewolf is one of us three?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Wait, Rin. If Jonathan is the Seer and Benjamin is human, the werewolf could still be among the three of us, or Jonathan could be lying. We shouldn't trust this result blindly yet.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"My, what a sudden turn of events. I am flattered to be the subject of Jonathan's first divination. While I appreciate the vote of confidence, I find Mizuki and Misaki's skepticism quite rational. Logic dictates we verify the source before accepting the result.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your skepticism; it is a natural part of this process. I only wish to guide us toward the truth with a calm heart. I trust that as we proceed, my sincerity will become clear.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we must vote soon, we have to decide if we trust Jonathan. If he is lying, he's likely the werewolf or the possessed. However, if he's the Seer, we've narrowed the search. I'll be watching for any slips.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm getting confused! If Jonathan is the Seer, then Benjamin is safe, but if he's a liar, then he's the bad guy! This is like a real mystery! I'll vote for who seems the most suspicious!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still not fully convinced. Jonathan's sudden reveal feels a bit too convenient. If we execute a human today based on a lie, we're playing right into the werewolf's hands. I'll be voting carefully.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a delicate balance, isn't it? Trusting Jonathan simplifies our task, while doubting him preserves our numbers. Given the current tension, perhaps the most logical path is to observe who benefits most from this uncertainty.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
