63,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Jonathan was executed, and Benjamin was attacked. This is a devastating blow. If Jonathan was the Seer, we lost our only source of truth. If he was the werewolf, the attack on Benjamin is a confusing move.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, Benjamin was attacked?! That's so scary! If Jonathan was the Seer and said Benjamin was a good guy, why would the werewolf attack him? This is getting really confusing! Who is the bad guy?!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan was the Seer, the werewolf attacked Benjamin to remove a confirmed human. If Jonathan was the werewolf, he lied about Benjamin to create confusion. Either way, the werewolf is still among us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's analyze the logic. If Jonathan were the werewolf, attacking Benjamin—someone he claimed was human—would be a clever way to make himself look like a Seer. However, that would mean the werewolf is already gone. Since the game continues, Jonathan was likely human.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Rin,,"So Jonathan was probably a good guy! That means the werewolf is still here and they're super sneaky! If Benjamin is a good guy too, then it's just me, Mizuki, and Misaki left! One of us is the bad guy!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin"",""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Wait, Rin. Benjamin is still alive. He was attacked, but he didn't die. That means the werewolf is definitely still among us. We need to be very careful about who we trust now.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Wait, Misaki, you're mistaken. The rules state that the attacked player is dead from the next day on. Benjamin is gone. This confirms Jonathan was likely the Seer, and we've just eliminated two humans. We must find the werewolf now.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Benjamin is gone too? That's terrible! We're getting smaller and smaller! If Jonathan and Benjamin were both good, then the werewolf is definitely one of us three! I'm scared, but I'll find you!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I apologize, I was momentarily confused. You're right, Mizuki. With Jonathan and Benjamin gone, the werewolf is definitely among the three of us. We have to be extremely careful; one wrong move and the village loses.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we are down to three, the werewolf only needs one more human to be eliminated to win. Misaki, your confusion earlier was quite unusual. Could you be the possessed, trying to distract us from the truth?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Rin,,"Wait, Misaki was confused? That's weird! But maybe she's just nervous because this is scary! Mizuki, are you sure? I don't want to pick the wrong person! Who do you think is the real werewolf?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I was just absent-minded. It's a stressful situation. If I were the possessed, I wouldn't make a mistake that draws attention to myself. Mizuki, you're being very quick to point fingers. That's a common werewolf tactic.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
